#: scenario6:scenario6_556C1399_D7A0_4B38_A6DB_6946491A8160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4053320d61a518333cf6a7527d642f92150fafd546bd6dcede578ed27bc55b38
#. default-sha256: 432a756fa0b4a0d132b04427214c6e86e536e199c3e8c189f81449f925b2b5ee
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_556C1399_D7A0_4B38_A6DB_6946491A8160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫I apologize for making you listen to my dreadful stories for so long. "
"⟪k:38⟫You must be quite weary of them by now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫Mi dispiace per averti fatto ascoltare le mie orribili storie per così "
"tanto tempo. ⟪k:38⟫Ormai ti avranno stancato."

#: scenario6:scenario6_22E7D063_B796_4594_A606_5DBD3B193E2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baca2bc044315d3b16bfd3df3e214e7b3627e75585d53d40375ad79393d62bc5
#. default-sha256: b46db61355406a57a8d6a21eb3d5121736b11a7ccf7fd24a781bef3e04a1c0a2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_22E7D063_B796_4594_A606_5DBD3B193E2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But worry not, for this is the final one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma non preoccuparti, perché la prossima sarà l’ultima."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5FFD9067_E11D_4279_AA9B_4F0DC72D8A27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9474758c1633f91db7be409abc18bde663d1a0ee99739007f7ba711fc98e050
#. default-sha256: 7c83c282c1b0caf44e352188abc62812da02fd4566e2609e2daad612e499fba8
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5FFD9067_E11D_4279_AA9B_4F0DC72D8A27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And despite being the end, it is neither dramatic nor exciting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E nonostante sia la fine, non è né drammatica né eccitante."

#: scenario6:scenario6_72F9EB16_EAA9_4710_9482_6C51B1F9FC15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1ab8c7622ab79e4875febaa045d985d9e116626a9084c4301c57416dce8383b
#. default-sha256: 4f5509f857d5138b9254abfeaffa83725485dc4736c00ab7615ba9d07f9a9e33
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_72F9EB16_EAA9_4710_9482_6C51B1F9FC15"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a single phrase—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the most insignificant of things—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Fu una singola frase—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫la cosa più insignificante—"

#: scenario6:scenario6_076A4C37_956A_4FC0_B6F2_2CEC0EEF1EB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e1c116f9a657ffd08d588a9693376d009c21e24582189c9267786d77c197614
#. default-sha256: 16617bfde112f78ca2750631cab90de119ab4ed112a5c614832e22ad884da474
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_076A4C37_956A_4FC0_B6F2_2CEC0EEF1EB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫that caused me to completely lose myself and forget I had, long ago, been the woman called "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫a far sì che io mi perdessi completamente, dimenticando che un tempo ero stata la donna "
"chiamata Giselle."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FF896C7C_8BFE_4088_A051_EDE1EE66FF96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01647f41cf6f5d76ae6ac330e0178b078902642385c66c8c732c3bca085a207e
#. default-sha256: 8b21f8d8b98586681dca86a2f887054a35eda18580da9787d516db77e5b9eabc
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FF896C7C_8BFE_4088_A051_EDE1EE66FF96"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There was no malice in it. ⟪k:1⟫It was but a simple greeting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non c’era cattiveria da parte sua. ⟪k:1⟫Il suo non era altro che un semplice saluto."

#: scenario6:scenario6_53347EC4_B414_492B_993D_8757F2C0E14B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65450e6b49ea5ef122a9c282a7217284801024523e616a003f52cc836669b54d
#. default-sha256: dae4650708c4c4c039f228deb1d8842446dadae182891ea5c321fa97bb2ea0b1
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_53347EC4_B414_492B_993D_8757F2C0E14B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do you remember how, the first time she arrived,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ricordi la prima volta in cui era arrivata,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_10F6EC42_4F81_46A1_BC78_36A8A802846B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0372f2807cd5ff93c6c85d5bbb8d15d291fe5f52e25bd3657c0c91ef57ff049e
#. default-sha256: bcf5f144c1c63f8d37534d2c17179688fb4ccdc4b3540df949ac72cba70f1403
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_10F6EC42_4F81_46A1_BC78_36A8A802846B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Michel” said I had a peculiar presence about me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She felt something there between "
"us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫quando “Michel” aveva detto che in me c’era qualcosa di particolare?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aveva "
"percepito che c’era qualcosa tra noi."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FEA9E9B7_5E6D_4C21_8873_F2ABE720FA54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 405e68b8d914dbc79651b2c26f79ae5511030b3de81ffc72c65a7ff9c425cd64
#. default-sha256: c39d4d6c2390ef19203bbe5b9740164eac065451bb0f1134cb577273a1df4081
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FEA9E9B7_5E6D_4C21_8873_F2ABE720FA54"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the second time, she said something about me seemed familiar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not "
"remember why, but her soul recognized the bonds we shared."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La seconda volta aveva detto che qualcosa in me le era familiare.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non ricordava "
"perché, ma la sua anima aveva riconosciuto il legame che avevamo condiviso."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F06992C8_18FF_4B48_8EA8_D9231880549E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3764e700d23ad0047b51fb93b6e66c400ea3e8182a4addf648d5096bc076b943
#. default-sha256: 707fdfbbdf2f6316e641bbc1463bab8191a11344048b45eb0bfea8a26dd6d4c3
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F06992C8_18FF_4B48_8EA8_D9231880549E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I assumed that the next time she showed up, she would feel something even stronger, ⟪k:1⟫"
"or perhaps even have her memories."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Così diedi per scontato che la volta successiva in cui si sarebbe presentata, avrebbe "
"provato qualcosa di ancora più forte,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o forse avrebbe addirittura recuperato la memoria."

#: scenario6:scenario6_1051D477_1775_45A0_8D7B_5C6294BD13D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 836f7e38837a648eb795979f6aa5e70dae9ed63f799aa5ee83c2163df3b8d670
#. default-sha256: 32d58f48ee4fd6b1eeb5521c1e138dca21fad7234276cd0626f1b95a2ad9d126
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1051D477_1775_45A0_8D7B_5C6294BD13D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite having been let down again and again, I still held on to the faintest glimmer of "
"hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonostante fossi stata delusa ancora e ancora, continuavo a reggermi al più debole barlume "
"di speranza."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5D0DB885_0ECC_4ECB_9B27_6A1CF4DE51C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 780950077ac664a2abfe22a550ebcc0206e13139e0bf583ad20f503c92d97727
#. default-sha256: 84e08eaea2e03d81643d6381e6619f9f6bc9e4cf0f8c453869091c64a66a6359
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5D0DB885_0ECC_4ECB_9B27_6A1CF4DE51C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But when she appeared, ⟪k:1⟫she was someone else’s wife."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma quando si ripresentò, ⟪k:1⟫era la moglie di qualcun altro."

#: scenario6:scenario6_CCAA917E_5CB3_4728_BF9E_D35A17A92BF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ceeb4038d59d44ca099cfe332b2e8a18ca55ca9d852329f364528216fb83b4ae
#. default-sha256: a00cb79109c50283f8f029ad109e4c885f1a1c72b4e8444853cc176255ef27aa
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_CCAA917E_5CB3_4728_BF9E_D35A17A92BF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hey! Hey, head maid!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Get out here!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ehi! Ehi, capodomestica!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Vieni qui!"

#: scenario6:scenario6_B9FFC48D_8468_4417_89FD_3726CB41A310
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd7888036d1c9a1c4f7185da88b744b3a71668bf6e31840eee35a6519c0c73e6
#. default-sha256: fba0437feac2784ba5e8d3ad43fb23e2c7453dd7ba18a4406dc2f841a9cafe10
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_B9FFC48D_8468_4417_89FD_3726CB41A310"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am right here, sir.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is something the matter?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sono proprio qui, signore.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Qualcosa non va?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_03232306_DBE0_4747_B3FA_10B5730DBEB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1801bb680bf7e585d502b91b68826b5abaca2e6a9ce7a9ee148230f5c93c4fb3
#. default-sha256: 3857b8d48020189ae0de251e1f8df8ca1bd23c41eec86b458f6b9e896cec8119
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_03232306_DBE0_4747_B3FA_10B5730DBEB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I figured you should get to know her as soon as possible,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫since you’ll be "
"spending a lot of time looking after her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ho pensato che avresti dovuto conoscerla il prima possibile,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫dato che "
"passerai molto tempo ad occuparti di lei."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D13813BA_B5BC_4EC9_A313_D3F0B67349BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4efda0aa932b2ef54b192197727501ff0a6c8ae7cae39347f32b979ddf719e0
