#: scenario6:scenario6_8CE9F3FD_FF79_4F19_9C53_3646DD9D5407
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8699aa4ca310b397b61547709c913157cb861035869cffc0fc71ee5af16b3c47
